# Generated scoring output, written to the repo root by `techinves-score`.
# The bare `scores.json` rule alone let the dated variants
# (`scores_2026-W33.json`) slip into git -- 236 KB of regenerable data
# carrying a week identity ADR 0010 retired. Both rules are root-anchored on
# purpose: `front-end/lib/data/scores.json` is a tracked demo fixture, not
# generated output, and an unanchored pattern would claim it too.
/scores.json
/scores_*.json

# Local run logs, written to the repo root by the pipeline/score CLIs
# (pipeline_run*.log, run_live*.log, score_run.log).
/*.log

# Ad-hoc database and data-file backups taken around migrations
# (data/dev_backup_pre_faz1_migration.db, data/*_backup_*.json).
data/*backup*.json
data/*backup*.db

# The agent working-memory layer (agent reports, syntheses, ADRs, backlog)
# is local-only: it drives the development workflow on this machine and is
# deliberately not part of the published repo.
/reports/
